        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.441,
            0.67,
            0.461
          ],
          "content": "2. What is an appropriate title for the above table?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.465,
            0.847,
            0.503
          ],
          "content": "3. How much is the population of Pune in 2011? Approximately, by how much has it increased compared to 2001?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.508,
            0.839,
            0.528
          ],
          "content": "4. Which city’s population increased the most between 2001 and 2011?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.532,
            0.847,
            0.57
          ],
          "content": "5. Are there cities whose population has almost doubled? Which are they?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.575,
            0.848,
            0.614
          ],
          "content": "6. By what number should we multiply Patna’s population to get a number/population close to that of Mumbai?"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
